{
  "_comment": [
    "CI shards: `pytest --ci-shard <suite>:<group>[,<group>...]` keeps only the tests of those groups.",
    "An entry is a test file (all its tests) or file::function (all its parametrizations).",
    "<suite>:rest is every test the command collected that no group of that suite names, so a new",
    "test file runs in the rest shard without being listed here. A group should stay under ~7 minutes",
    "on a slow runner (minutes noted from the 3.11 job of master's run 37709671308), leaving ~3 for",
    "checkout and installs inside the ~10-minute target. Checked by tests/test_ci_shards.py."
  ],
